Z||000004||87GTZ34||09-13-2001||10:46 AM||||Dumb - You are shooting in the dark with repect to using these injectors and an adjustable regulator.  You need to map the flow changes to your motor and get the flow maps for the injectors over pressures and then have a custom EPROM burned for your ECM and this application.  Otherwise there is no engineering in your setup and hence it is a roll of the dice.  Most likely the car will run rich and not lean but it will by no means be optimum.  GL||||reg||1
